 "questions": [
  {
   "id": 631808,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stem_html": "<p>Using a calculator, Joanna made the following table and then made the following conjecture: <span data-math=\"3x\">3x</span> is always greater than <span data-math=\"(1.02)^x\">(1.02)^x</span>. Is Joanna correct? Explain.</p>\n<table class=\"unnumbered\">\n  <thead>\n    <tr>\n      <th scope=\"col\"><span data-math=\"x\">x</span></th>\n      <th scope=\"col\"><span data-math=\"(1.02)^x\">(1.02)^x</span></th>\n      <th scope=\"col\"><span data-math=\"3x\">3x</span></th>\n    </tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n      <td>1</td>\n      <td>1.02</td>\n      <td>3</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>2</td>\n      <td>1.0404</td>\n      <td>6</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>3</td>\n      <td>1.0612</td>\n      <td>9</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>4</td>\n      <td>1.0824</td>\n      <td>12</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>5</td>\n      <td>1.1041</td>\n      <td>15</td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>",
   "answers": [
    {
     "id": 1222840,
     "content_html": "Joanna is incorrect. If you continue the table to <span data-math=\"x=300\">x=300</span>, <span data-math=\"(1.02)^x\">(1.02)^x</span> is greater than <span data-math=\"3x\">3x</span>."
    },
    {
     "id": 1222843,
     "content_html": "Joanna is incorrect. Since <span data-math=\"(1.02)^x\">(1.02)^x</span> is exponential growth and <span data-math=\"3x\">3x</span> is linear growth, eventually <span data-math=\"(1.02)^x\">(1.02)^x</span> will be greater than <span data-math=\"3x\">3x</span>."
    },
    {
     "id": 1222841,
     "content_html": "Joanna is correct. If you graph the points in the table for <span data-math=\"(1.02)^x\">(1.02)^x</span> and <span data-math=\"3x\">3x</span>, the points for <span data-math=\"3x\">3x</span> are all above the points for <span data-math=\"(1.02)^x\">(1.02)^x</span>."
    },
    {
     "id": 1222842,
     "content_html": "Joanna is correct. None of the values in the table for <span data-math=\"(1.02)^x\">(1.02)^x</span> are greater than the values for <span data-math=\"3x\">3x</span>."
    }
   ],
